		{
			"id":"95719faaffd98312",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n## 当容易移项同构时\n\n![[_attachments/image/常数k值法-1787542602860.jpeg]]\n\n\n![[_attachments/image/常数k值法-1787542710709.jpeg]]\n",
