		},
		{
			"id":"ff7b30052ef614d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n\n死板用套路不可行，有时需修正所用函数：\n\n![[_attachments/image/常数k值法-1787540623290.jpeg]]\n\n\n![[_attachments/image/常数k值法-1787540683897.jpeg]]\n![[_attachments/image/常数k值法-1787540724318.jpeg]]\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":215,
			"width":320,
			"height":240,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"5a58eb86e8c20e53",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n- 修正所用函数，比如给函数乘/除某个东西，往结论靠\n- 多次求导\n- 当容易移项同构时，移项完函数就构造了\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1780,
			"y":55,
			"width":320,
			"height":156,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
